<view class="pg10-page release-page" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px">
  <view class="release-status-bar" style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px" aria-hidden="true"></view>
  <view class="pg10-header release-header" style="padding-right: {{headerPaddingRight}}; top: {{statusBarHeight}}px">
    <button class="pg10-back" bindtap="back" aria-label="返回"><image src="assets/back.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></button>
    <view class="pg10-header-title">Meetup Info</view>
    <view class="pg10-header-actions">
      <button class="pg10-header-share" open-type="share" aria-label="分享当前功能与版本说明"><image src="assets/share.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></button>
      <button class="pg10-header-more" bindtap="toggleMore" aria-label="更多页面入口" aria-expanded="{{moreOpen}}"><image src="assets/more.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></button>
      <button class="pg10-header-avatar" bindtap="goProfile" aria-label="返回我的页面"><image src="assets/person.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{moreOpen}}" class="pg10-header-menu" style="right: {{headerPaddingRight}}"><button bindtap="goAbout">关于 Project IRL　›</button><button bindtap="goProfile">我的页面　›</button></view>
  </view>
  <view class="release-content">
    <view class="release-intro pg10-card">
      <view class="intro-glow" aria-hidden="true"></view>
      <view class="release-status"><view class="version-chip"><view class="status-dot"></view><text>R1 · 本地测试候选</text></view><view class="ability-chip"><image src="assets/verified.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>当前工程能力</text></view></view>
      <view class="whats-new">WHAT'S NEW ✨</view>
      <view class="release-title">让一场真实活动，顺利发生</view>
      <view class="release-intro-note"><image src="assets/event.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>发布状态以小程序当前工程为准；正式版本号与上线日期待确认。</text></view>
      <view class="intro-highlight"><view class="intro-highlight-icon"><image src="assets/auto-awesome.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view>从灵感草稿到活动确认，按真实记录逐步完成</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="release-card draft-card pg10-card">
      <view class="feature-heading"><view class="feature-heading-main"><view class="feature-icon blue"><image src="assets/mic.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="feature-heading-copy"><view class="feature-kicker">能力 01</view><view class="feature-title">从想法到活动草稿</view></view></view><text class="ability-pill">已接通</text></view>
      <view class="feature-image"><image class="scene-photo" src="assets/reference-scene-1.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="photo-caption"><view class="photo-dot"></view><text>活动场景示意配图 · 非真实活动照片</text></view></view>
      <view class="feature-points">
        <view class="feature-point"><view class="point-heading"><image src="assets/graphic-eq.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>字段建议与核实</text></view><view class="point-body">主办方核实时间、场地、费用、人数和规则后保存草稿；生产环境采用规则提取。</view></view>
        <view class="feature-point"><view class="point-heading"><image src="assets/stylus-note.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>人工审核发布</text></view><view class="point-body">受控活动通过审核后开放邀请和报名。</view></view>
        <view class="feature-point"><view class="point-heading"><image src="assets/partly-cloudy-day.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>当前能力边界</text></view><view class="point-body">真实 AI 语音建局与自动订场尚未开放。</view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="release-card pg10-card">
      <view class="feature-heading"><view class="feature-heading-main"><view class="feature-icon violet"><image src="assets/receipt-long.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="feature-heading-copy"><view class="feature-kicker violet-text">能力 02</view><view class="feature-title">邀请、报名与协作</view></view></view><text class="ability-pill violet-pill">已接通</text></view>
      <view class="feature-image"><image class="scene-photo" src="assets/reference-scene-2.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="photo-label"><image src="assets/check-circle.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>活动场景示意配图</text></view></view>
      <view class="feature-points">
        <view class="feature-point"><view class="point-heading"><image src="assets/document-scanner.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>候补与协办</text></view><view class="point-body">支持报名审批、预留名额、候补顺序、协办权限及重大变更重新确认。</view></view>
        <view class="feature-point"><view class="point-heading"><image src="assets/swap-horiz.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>站内状态通知</text></view><view class="point-body">活动变化会写入站内通知；外部消息取决于正式配置。</view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="release-card pg10-card">
      <view class="feature-heading"><view class="feature-heading-main"><view class="feature-icon pink"><image src="assets/military-tech.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="feature-heading-copy"><view class="feature-kicker pink-text">能力 03</view><view class="feature-title">签到、AA 与安全</view></view></view><text class="ability-pill pink-pill">已接通</text></view>
      <view class="feature-triplet"><view class="triplet-item"><view class="triplet-icon green"><image src="assets/shield.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><text>动态口令签到</text></view><view class="triplet-item"><view class="triplet-icon blue-soft"><image src="assets/bolt.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><text>费用分摊标记</text></view><view class="triplet-item"><view class="triplet-icon pink-soft"><image src="assets/favorite.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><text>举报申诉入口</text></view></view>
      <view class="feature-points">
        <view class="feature-point"><view class="point-heading"><image src="assets/verified-user.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>边界清晰</text></view><view class="point-body">费用标记不是付款凭证。</view></view>
        <view class="feature-point"><view class="point-heading"><image src="assets/photo-library.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>独立处理流程</text></view><view class="point-body">举报、屏蔽和本人数据请求都有独立流程。</view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="release-card pg10-card">
      <view class="optimization-heading"><image src="assets/build-circle.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="feature-title">体验优化与细节修复</view></view>
      <view class="feature-points"><view class="optimization-point"><view class="optimization-dot"></view><text>当前 UI 正按设计稿持续还原，交互以本地实际功能为准。</text></view><view class="optimization-point"><view class="optimization-dot"></view><text>路线和状态经过开发者工具与本地测试验证，真机验收仍待资源。</text></view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="release-card unavailable-card pg10-card"><view class="feature-title">后续方向</view><view class="pg10-note">公开找局、私聊、线上支付、自动订场、活动相册、勋章、真实 AI 语音建局与人工客服尚未开放。</view></view>
    <view class="release-footer"><view class="footer-icon"><image src="assets/favorite-footer.svg" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="release-foot">感谢你关注现实世界里的真实相聚</view><view class="release-actions"><button bindtap="goCreate">发起受控活动</button><button bindtap="goActivities">查看我的活动</button></view></view>
  </view>
</view>
